      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Certainly! Here's a draft for your quarterly performance review of Marcus:\n\n\"Marcus, your ability to secure and maintain client relationships is truly commendable. Your numbers are a testament to your skill in navigating the market, and your dedication to our clients is as unwavering as a steadfast mountain. However, it's important to note that punctuality is a cornerstone of our team's success. While your sales acumen is as sharp as a dragon's tooth, your consistent tardiness to our morning stand-up meetings has been a thorn in the side of our team's morale. We value your contributions, but we must also emphasize the importance of being on time. Let's work together to ensure that your presence, as timely as the first light of dawn, is felt in every meeting and every quarter.\"",
