    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, but the \"dragon's tooth\" and \"steadfast mountain\" stuff feels a bit too dramatic for our corporate culture. We need to keep it strictly professional. \n\nCan you try another version? This time, instead of those metaphors, can you add a sentence about how Marcus has a bit of a \"wild\" or \"unpredictable\" energy in the office? He's very creative and high-energy, but sometimes that energy makes him feel a little disconnected from the standard office routine. I want to frame it as a personality trait that needs more structure.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
