      "role": "user",
      "content": "Thanks, this version is much better and more professional. One thing though—I want to be very specific about that \"unpredictable energy\" I mentioned. Instead of just saying \"dynamic presence,\" I want to describe how his energy can sometimes feel a bit disruptive or chaotic, almost like he's operating on a different wavelength than the rest of the office. It's not bad, it's just... unconventional.\n\nCan you refine the middle section to capture that feeling of him being a bit of a \"wild card\" who sometimes lacks a bit of discipline in his daily habits? Try to make it sound like he has this spirited, slightly chaotic nature that needs to be reined in with structure.",
